{"4345150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Reaper Shoots! 2", "steam_appid": 4345150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>🎮 Steam Deck Support Updated!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We now support various controllers and Steam Deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・ Controllers (Xbox Controller / DualShock / DualSense)<br>・ Steam Deck</p></p><br><h1>💌To All Players of the Original Mobile Version of Dark Reaper Shoots!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Since our launch in 2013, we have been profoundly grateful for the immense love and support from fans all around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after the service ended, your unyielding passion and endless emails with requests such as &quot;Please bring the Game back&quot; were the ultimate driving force that brought the Dark Reaper Shoots! 2 project to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to take this opportunity to express our deepest gratitude to each and every one of you who reached out to us. Fueled by your passion, SummerTimeStudio will continue to push boundaries and take on new challenges.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Reaper Shoots! 2 is a new sequel to the smartphone game Dark Reaper Shoots!, which previously recorded 5.30 million downloads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome relentless attacks and dominate the battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect skills and acquire more powerful abilities. Skill combinations can lead to significant power-ups! Customize your style to your liking and bring victory to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect materials in various stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen yourself with materials obtained from the stages and advance to new, unseen stages. In addition to the skill tree, you can enhance your abilities and acquire special skills by crafting weapons and masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Power Up Your Partner, Gawgaw!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gawgaw is the familiar and loyal companion of the lonely Grim Reaper. Despite its cute appearance, it's a powerful support character that can easily defeat numerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Streaming and Video Content Guidelines:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome both corporate and individual creators to live stream and post gameplay videos.<br>No prior permission or application is required, so please feel free to stream and share your videos!<br>Including the link to our Store Page in your video description or overview would be greatly appreciated and highly encouraging for the development team!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Reaper Shoots! 2 is a new sequel to the smartphone game Dark Reaper Shoots!, which previously recorded 5.30 million downloads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/bf132b3ac31d9b878b06c53010654151.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome relentless attacks and dominate the battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect skills and acquire more powerful abilities. Skill combinations can lead to significant power-ups! Customize your style to your liking and bring victory to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/29e85c12edb7dc88a1a404a3b2bbb7d8.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect materials in various stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen yourself with materials obtained from the stages and advance to new, unseen stages. In addition to the skill tree, you can enhance your abilities and acquire special skills by crafting weapons and masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.poster.avif?t=1786520540\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.webm?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/extras/09afe09635df5f1e2763318441a3e02e.mp4?t=1786520540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Power Up Your Partner, Gawgaw!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gawgaw is the familiar and loyal companion of the lonely Grim Reaper. Despite its cute appearance, it's a powerful support character that can easily defeat numerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Streaming and Video Content Guidelines:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome both corporate and individual creators to live stream and post gameplay videos.<br>No prior permission or application is required, so please feel free to stream and share your videos!<br>Including the link to our Store Page in your video description or overview would be greatly appreciated and highly encouraging for the development team!</p>", "short_description": "Become a Grim Reaper seeking peace and mow down the beasts of hell! This is a casual roguelike survivor action game where you craft various weapons, grow stronger with your partner GawGaw, and fight your way through the battles.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/1e2776627c11af9bde655e1072b605415048ca40/header.jpg?t=1786520540", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/ca8e057c151bf78fb4f4c902b5828eb6585ddb8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786520540", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/ca8e057c151bf78fb4f4c902b5828eb6585ddb8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786520540", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 Sequoia or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or better (Apple Silicon only)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16384 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2560 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Core Audio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. SSD recommended. Intel-based Macs are not supported.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 Sequoia or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M3 or better (Apple Silicon only)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16384 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M3 integrated GPU or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2560 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Core Audio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system. SSD recommended. Intel-based Macs are not supported.</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["SummerTimeStudio"], "publishers": ["SummerTimeStudio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 531, "final": 531, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.31"}, "packages": [1518714], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Dark Reaper Shoots! 2", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1518714, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Dark Reaper Shoots! 2 - $5.31", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 531}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4345150/6cf083d5572e